<title>USA: Cache February same-store sales declined.</title>
<headline>Cache February same-store sales declined.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>			 1997	1996   Total   Same-store</p>
<p>Month	     $  8.8    $  9.2    -4.0	-8.0</p>
<p>NOTES: Latest month is four weeks ended February 22, 1997.</p>
<p>Company said decrease in sales primarily due to a sales</p>
<p>promotion held in February 1996 which was not held in</p>
<p>February this year.</p>
<p>Cache Inc.</p>
</text>
